  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "大家沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "沒、沒事，整棟樓都不見了......那到底是什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "你呢？你剛才直接穿過了法術的正中心吧，總是那麼亂來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "噗嗤，我這才發現，怎麼把長頭髮剪短了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "喂，你剛剛笑出來了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "頭上都沾滿了沙子，就算是短髮也不能不珍惜啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我沒事的啦，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "......謝謝？我們已經這麼生疏了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "這只說明我講文明懂禮貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "呵呵，說的也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "如果你不總是在工作時間睡覺，在教堂外搞搖滾樂演出，出了岔子再讓公證所的人追你三條街的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "被你失手炸掉的母校在你離開拉特蘭的那一天可是拉了橫幅的哦？“歡送能天使前往龍門”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "什麼？這是老友聚會互揭傷疤之類的必備項目嗎？好啊，該我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "請便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......不好，這麼一想，我好像都不太清楚你的黑歷史！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "好孩子不該知道那麼多喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你是我老姐嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "欸，差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（這兩個人好像關係很好呢，因為都是拉特蘭人嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（而且能天使竟然也會被搶走話語權......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那個......莫斯提馬。我還是有一點小問題要問啦，小小的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "為什麼這個時候回來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "唔，嗯，原因是有不少啦，怎麼說呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "第一，是工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "第二，龍門安魂節總是會搞促銷嘛，回龍門湊個熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......那麼多年的安魂夜你都不知所蹤，偏偏在今年回來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "其實你想問的不是這個吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "誒......你察覺到了就直接告訴我嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "呵呵，難得看到你糾結的樣子，讓人很懷念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "而且，不管怎麼說，也不能當著來參觀學習的人面說那些彎彎繞繞的話題呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "啊......沒事，我會在後面跟著的，你們請便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "這可不行，還不排除被追蹤的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊！用拜松當藉口也太狡猾了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "先和德克薩斯他們會合吧，那麼多嚇人的黑手黨還在虎視眈眈呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "我不在的時候，你們總是這麼惹麻煩嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "也算不上經常？每周有個四五六七八天的樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "......嗯，的確不太經常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那你呢？去了哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你知道我剛見到老闆的時候，老闆說你已經離開龍門了，那種長跑到終點線前摔了一跤的感覺嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "很多地方，多到數不清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "來到一座無人問津的村子，接下一封信，再前往群山的另一面，追著移動城市跑，就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "聽著真孤獨呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "但寫成遊記的話說不定能大賣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "莫斯提馬小姐，去過所有國家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "大部分吧，羡慕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......有一點，一般的信使是不會有這樣的機會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "會有機會的。不過你可別指望企鵝物流哦，我們是不能用常理來判斷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "關於這點，我已經心知肚明了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "在漫漫大漠中坐著卡車，盯著落日穿過黃沙，聽著是很浪漫，但當浪漫持續上百個小時的時候，也就消磨殆盡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "黃沙落日我是沒怎麼見到過啦，但你不覺得今天沙塵很大嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "這幾年龍門的空氣品質下降了不少喔，該增加幾台空氣淨化器了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "空氣品質嗎......也許吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "能天使，拜松，雖然很抱歉，但你們得先——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松&能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "又來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "哎呀，我對自己離開的時機拿捏的還是比較好的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......你認真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "但是對你而言只是幾個小時，對我而言可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "算了，莫斯提馬！回頭請我吃飯！必須！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "——知道啦知道啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "......真是的，今晚還真熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "我們真的就拋下莫斯提馬小姐一個人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "誰拋下誰？反正就算不聽她的，她也會在哪個時間點突然消失的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......你在生氣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "——啊啊！先去找德克薩斯！剩下的之後再說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "能天使那傢伙，這種時候，偏偏不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "呃，我們這是惹上麻煩了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "他們把我們包圍了。突然出現的敵人，一開始就埋伏在貧民窟裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這些傢伙，是和那些黑手黨一夥的？可看著不像啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "不，有幾個熟悉的面孔，都是龍門本地人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "聽老大的，給他們點教訓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯，嗯？嗯......我們不是在找德克薩斯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "發生了什麼，我們才會被這些突然冒出來的傢伙包圍的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......是你們闖進來的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "看吧！還不是因為能天使你瞎指路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "很抱歉，你們不能輕易離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "既然你也是豐蹄，也拿著面盾——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那可頌和我怎麼辦，咱們就怎麼辦！你開路，我殿後，但這次估計沒獎金了，上啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
